<title>UK: EIB sets A$100 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets A$100 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  A$100 MLN COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    22.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.50    PAY DATE    22.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
